# Try the API from Rider / VS Code REST Client. Start the API first (dotnet run).
@host = http://localhost:5105

### Log in as the demo rider
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "rider@joyridr.dev", "password": "Password123!" }

### Cars near Zagreb city centre
GET {{host}}/api/cars/nearby?latitude=45.8131&longitude=15.9775&radiusKm=25
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### My upcoming rides
GET {{host}}/api/rides?view=upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
